  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 1106.02 Receipt and Acceptance of Funds. Pursuant to the department of administrative services’ manual of procedures, the department shall receive and expend funds for the purpose of establishing programs to protect endangered or threatened plant species.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17\n\nNew. #12825, INTERIM, eff 7-10-19, EXPIRES: 1-6-20",
